So we have failing tests. And I need to make them pass. This is like when I had to unify the Scranton and Stamford branches - except with less drama and more semicolons. Or... no semicolons? This is Go. Go doesn't need them. Just like I don't need validation from my employees. But I want it. I WANT IT SO BAD.

